  {
    n: 13,
    name: 'ClickUp',
    customer: 'The Card Grid',
    product: 'Productivity platform.',
    url: 'clickup.com/customers',
    why: "ClickUp has between 61 and 100+ case studies depending on which aggregator you trust. Cartoon Network cut content creation and publishing time by 50% while doubling social channels managed at the same team size. Yggdrasil Gaming saved $120,000 per game and reduced development cost by 30%. DISH Network's PMO increased project efficiency by 30% and handled 10% more complex projects. The metrics, where they exist, are good.",
